The '''2024–25 season''' was the 102nd season in the history of '''[[Villarreal CF|Villarreal Club de Fútbol]]''', and the club's 12th consecutive season in [[La Liga]]. In addition to the [[2024–25 La Liga|domestic league]], the club participated in the [[2024–25 Copa del Rey|Copa del Rey]].

Villarreal did not participate in any European competition for the first time since the [[2019–20 Villarreal CF season|2019–20 season]], due to their eighth-place league finish in the previous campaign.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://castellonplaza.com/villarreal-ya-tiene-su-museo-una-gran-muestra-de-su-historia-con-la-europa-league-como-colofon|title=El Villarreal ya tiene su museo: una gran muestra de su historia con la Europa League como colofón|website=Castellonplaza|language=es}}</ref>

